<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SADV41 - Corona Incorruptible</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0d1117;
            color: #c9d1d9;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: #161b22;
            border: 1px solid #30363d;
            border-radius: 12px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #58a6ff;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .header span {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #8b949e;
        }
        .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .stat-box {
            background: #0d1117;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #21262d;
        }
        .label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #8b949e;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .value {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #f0f6fc;
        }
        .description {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #8b949e;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-left: 3px solid #238636;
            padding-left: 10px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .mission-footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #79c0ff;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .emoji {
            font-size: 2rem;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>POST /activities</h1>
        <span>Misión SADV41 - Registro de Carrera</span>
    </div>

    <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat-box">
            <span class="label">Name</span>
            <span class="value">Corona Incorruptible</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
            <span class="label">Sport Type</span>
            <span class="value">Walk (Fe)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
            <span class="label">Distance</span>
            <span class="value">18,300 m</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
            <span class="label">Elapsed Time</span>
            <span class="value">15,120 s</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="description">
        "Desde la 2 de Mayo por el camino viejo hacia La Chorrera. Cada paso es una victoria sobre la carne, buscando el séptimo cielo bajo la guianza del Espíritu Santo."
    </div>

    <div class="mission-footer">
        ORIGEN 0 - EL SEÑOR ES TODO
        <span class="emoji">🎚</span>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
